  "limitations": "This is a local model-free runtime benchmark with deterministic provider and task fixtures, temporary files, and injected static key and anchor stores. It measures harness coordination and fail-closed protected-state contracts, not model intelligence, live provider latency, production Keychain behavior, process or power-loss recovery, or superiority over OpenClaw, Hermes, or another harness. The latency profile is selected from a closed set using the report's self-reported, non-attested operating-system label; Windows changes only the checkpoint-resume and workload-total durability ceilings. Latency has not been independently reproduced. This local evidence is not authorization for public benchmark claims.",
